            "content": "<p>Push Scent Refills cannot be used in water based ultrasonic diffusers -- They are expertly designed to work with our Push Plug-In Diffuser. Push Scent refills are natural aroma oils, composed of essential oils and naturally derived compounds from plants. Water based essential oil diffusers are designed to work with different essential oil consistency.</p>"
