          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use my diffuser blend in the Push Diffuser?",
            "content": "<p>You are unable to use your existing diffuser blends with the Push Plug-In Diffuser. The Push Plug-In Diffuser must be used with the Push Scent Refills. The Push Scent Refills are expertly crafted to ensure consistent diffusing and are created specifically to work with our Push Plug-In Diffuser. </p>"
