            "title": "How does the Push Plug-In Diffuser diffuse scent?",
            "content": "<p>The Push Plug-In Diffuser uses a simple, yet effective method to bring your favorite scents into your home. The wick absorbs the natural oil, and a heater gently warms the wick, allowing the fragrance to be released into the air. We’ve designed specialized ventilation to improve airflow and enhance the performance, ensuring a more consistent and long-lasting scent experience<em>.</em></p>"
